><given-names>FC</given-names></name><name><surname>Stiles</surname><given-names>CD</given-names></name><name><surname>Antoniades</surname><given-names>HN</given-names></name><name><surname>Scher</surname><given-names>CD</given-names></name></person-group><year>1979</year><article-title>Platelet alpha granules contain a growth factor for fibroblasts.</article-title><source>Blood</source><volume>53</volume><fpage>1043</fpage><lpage>1052</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">444648</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0001729-Rosenkranz1"><label>13</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Rosenkranz</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Kazlauskas</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><year>1999</year><article-title>Evidence for distinct signaling properties and biological responses induced by the PDGF receptor alpha and beta subtypes.</article-title><source>Growth Factors</source><volume>16</volume><fpage>201</fpage><lpage>216</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10372961</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0001729-Seppa1"><label>14</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Seppa</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Grotendorst</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Seppa</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Schiffmann</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Martin</surname><given-names>GR</given-names></name></person-group><year>1982</year><article-title>Platelet-derived growth factor in chemotactic for fibroblasts.</article-title><source>J Cell Biol</source><volume>92</volume><fpage>584</fpage><lpage>588</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7061598</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0001729-Hsieh1"><label>15</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hsieh</surname><given-names>PC</given-names></name><name><surname>Davis</surname><given-names>ME</given-names></name><name><surname>Gannon</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>MacGillivray</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Lee</surname><given-names>RT</given-names></name></person-group><year>2006</year><article-title>Controlled delivery of PDGF-BB for myocardial protection using injectable self-assembling peptide nanofibers.</article-title><source>J Clin Invest</source><volume>116</volume><fpage>237</fpage><lpage>248</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16357943</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0001729-Hsieh2"><label>16</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hsieh</surname><given-names>PC</given-names></name><name><surname>MacGillivray</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Gannon</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Cruz</surname><given-names>FU</given-names></name><name><surname>Lee</surname><given-names>RT</given-names></name></person-group><year>2006</year><article-title>Local controlled intramyocardial delivery of platelet-derived growth factor improves postinfarction ventricular function without pulmonary toxicity.</article-title><source>Circulation</source><volume>114</volume><fpage>637</fpage><lpage>644</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16894033</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0001729-Chin1"><label>17</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Chin</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Zheng</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Duignan</surname><given-names>IJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Edelberg</surname><given-names>JM</given-names></name></person-group><year>2006</year><article-title>PDGF-AB-based functional cardioprotection of the aging rat heart.</article-title><source>Exp Gerontol</source><volume>41</volume><fpage>63</fpage><lpage>68</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16337354</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0001729-Zymek1"><label>18</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Zymek</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Bujak</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Chatila</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Cieslak</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Thakker</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2006</year><article-title>The role of platelet-derived growth factor signaling in healing myocardial infarcts.</article-title><source>J Am Coll Cardiol</source><volume>48</volume><fpage>2315</fpage><lpage>2323</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17161265</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0001729-Steed1"><label>19</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Steed</surname><given-names>DL</given-names></name></person-group><year>2006</year><article-title>Clinical evaluation of recombinant human platelet-derived growth factor for the treatment of lower extremity ulcers.</article-title><source>Plast Reconstr Surg</source><volume>117</volume><fpage>143S</fpage><lpage>149S</lpage><comment>discussion 150S&#x02013;151S</comment><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16799381</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0001729-Sarment1"><label>20</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Sarment</surname><given-names>DP</given-names></name><name><surname>Cooke</surname><given-names>JW</given-names></name><name><surname>Miller</surname><given-names>SE</given-names></name><name><surname>Jin</surname><given-names>Q</given-names></name><name><surname>McGuire</surname><given-names>MK</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2006</year><article-title>Effect of rhPDGF-BB on bone turnover during periodontal repair.</article-title><source